{"id": "34480", "title": "兽王驯悍", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34480.htm", "intro": "当海棠逸出那座阴暗、黑沉的海上孤狱时,他便发誓要遗忘--遗忘那段血腥、杀戮的过去！遗忘妻子与心腹大将联手背叛他的过去！但在命运的残忍播弄下,他又回到这罪恶、受诅咒的\"兽王堡\"前,在见到他的妻子--贺兰淳的那刻,狂暴的炽焰汹涌而出……他……回来了？望着眼前冷凝、阴鸷的海棠逸,恐惧、愤怒、爱恋在她心中交错。当年,为了他的残暴与征伐,她狠下心亲手陷他入狱。她宁愿他加倍地恨她、怨她,也要激他离开她！可这全是逼不得已……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34480", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2187938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2187939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2187960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2187961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2187962.html", "availabl